{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"To factor means to rewrite an expression as a product. Let's try dividing the expression $64f-64g+96$ by each factor.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $64$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}64f-64g+96\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=64\\left(\\dfrac{64f-64g+96}{64}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=64\\left(\\dfrac{64f}{64}-\\dfrac{64g}{64}+\\dfrac{96}{64}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=64(f-g+1.5)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $64f-64g+96$ is *not* equivalent to $64(f-g+2)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $8$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}64f-64g+96\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=8\\left(\\dfrac{64f-64g+96}{8}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=8\\left(\\dfrac{64f}{8}-\\dfrac{64g}{8}+\\dfrac{96}{8}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=8(8f-8g+12)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $64f-64g+96$ is equivalent to $8(8f-8g+12)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $4$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}64f-64g+96\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4\\left(\\dfrac{64f-64g+96}{4}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4\\left(\\dfrac{64f}{4}-\\dfrac{64g}{4}+\\dfrac{96}{4}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=4(16f-16g+24)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $64f-64g+96$ is *not* equivalent to $4(16f-16+24g)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $32$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}64f-64g+96\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=32\\left(\\dfrac{64f-64g+96}{32}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=32\\left(\\dfrac{64f}{32}-\\dfrac{64g}{32}+\\dfrac{96}{32}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=32(2f-2g+3)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $64f-64g+96$ is equivalent to $32(2f-2g+3)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $64f-64g+96$:\n\n- $8(8f-8g+12)$\n- $32(2f-2g+3)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Factor $64f-64g+96$ to identify the equivalent expressions.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $64f-64g+128$.","content":"$64(f-g+2)$","correct":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $64f-64g+96$.","content":"$8(8f-8g+12)$","correct":true},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $64f-64+96g$.","content":"$4(16f-16+24g)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $64f-64g+96$.","content":"$32(2f-2g+3)$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":true,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
